{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52359","headline":"诗 三 · 王梵志","name":"诗 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间不信我，言我□造恶。\n不能爲俗情，和光心自各。\n财色终不染，妻子不恋者。\n共□（任、陈皆补「你」字）□□（陈补「同」字）尘，至理求不错。\n智惠（陈校作「慧」）浑一愚，我心常离缚。\n君自未识真，余身桓（任录、项校均作「恒」）□（陈补「坦」字、项补「快」字）乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}